) what the AGI will do?**


Because a superintelligence will have sharp capability gains. After all, human beings do just within [our naturally-occurring variation](https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/vvc2MiZvWgMFaSbhx/book-review-the-bell-curve-by-charles-murray). Most people cannot write a bestselling novel or invent complicated recursive algorithms.


TL;DR
=====


AI Alignment is, effectively, a security problem. How do you secure against an adversary that is much smarter than you?




---



